    - target: {fileID: 7500671343821934536, guid: 53222a3d044d047ecaef21b5dfea0742, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Speed: 2          Agility: 3          Durability: 3          Stability:
        4

        Uranus is the 7th and coldest planet from the Sun. It''s also
        the only planet with its equator tilted at a right angle to its orbit, most
        likely due to a collision with an Earth-sized object long ago.

        Ability
        - Ringmaster: Uranus''s tilted rings deflect  nearby objects (hold ability
        key to spin rings).

        Duration: 20s          Cooldown: 20s'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
