    - target: {fileID: 7500671343821934536, guid: 53222a3d044d047ecaef21b5dfea0742, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Speed: 2          Agility: 2          Durability: 4          Stability:
        4

        Saturn is the 6th planet from the Sun, and the only one less dense
        than water. It has 146 moons, the most in the Solar System, and its iconic
        rings are mostly made of chunks of ice and rock.

        Ability - Lord
        of the Rings: Saturn''s rings deflect  nearby objects (hold ability key to
        spin rings).

        Duration: 20s          Cooldown: 20s'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
