    - target: {fileID: 7500671343821934536, guid: 53222a3d044d047ecaef21b5dfea0742, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Speed: 3          Agility: 3          Durability: 4          Stability:
        3

        Earth is the 3rd and densest planet from the Sun. Its ideal conditions,
        from its chemical composition and magnetic field to its place in the Solar
        System''s Goldilocks zone, make it the only place known with life.

        Ability
        - Planet of Life: Earth regenerates its health every second while activated.

        Duration:
        20s          Cooldown: 10s'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
